flowchart TB
  C["Small synthetic corpus<br/>and a canary check"]:::src
  K["yarac compiles the set<br/>time and memory measured"]:::val
  S["yara scans each file<br/>10 s limit per file"]:::val
  M["Per process: wall time,<br/>CPU, peak memory"]:::val
  R["Repeat 5 times,<br/>previous release and candidate"]:::val
  V{"Median above<br/>baseline noise floor?"}:::gate
  OK["no regression"]:::sec
  BAD["regression: isolate culprits"]:::qua
  NO["Not measured here:<br/>Installer Auditor with<br/>the live channel,<br/>concurrency, race conditions"]:::qua
  C --> K --> S --> M --> R --> V
  V -->|no| OK
  V -->|yes| BAD
